This package is an independent TypeScript implementation of the design of
OASIS (Open Agent Social Interaction Simulations), https://github.com/camel-ai/oasis,
Copyright the CAMEL-AI.org authors, licensed under the Apache License 2.0.

Borrowed from OASIS (design, not code): agents acting in time steps with an
activation probability; a recommendation table rebuilt between steps that
mixes interest similarity, a Reddit-style hot score and a time decay; a
refresh that adds the most-liked posts of followed accounts; a share of
recommendations swapped for random posts; the action space (create_post,
create_comment, like_post, dislike_post, repost, quote_post, follow,
do_nothing) and its constraints (one like per post, reposts and quotes
resolve to the root post); and interviewing an agent after the run.

No code from MiroFish (https://github.com/666ghj/MiroFish, AGPL-3.0) is
included.
